# Graphify — AmL Diagnostic (`diagnostic`)

Use this graph **only** when the task is AmL Diagnostic. Never run `graphify` in MessageMe (`messageme`) for Diagnostic work.

Repo root: `C:\Users\ambru\source\repos\aml-systems\diagnostic`

```powershell
Set-Location 'C:\Users\ambru\source\repos\aml-systems\diagnostic'
graphify query "<question>"
graphify path "<A>" "<B>"
graphify explain "<concept>"
graphify update .
```

If `graphify-out/graph.json` is missing, run `graphify .` **here**. After Diagnostic code changes: `graphify update .` from this root.
